WEBVTT

00:00:01.230 --> 00:00:02.380
Gainos.

00:00:02.380 --> 00:00:04.950
The ruling continent of the Queen's capital.

00:00:04.950 --> 00:00:10.040
For the purpose of becoming the new Queen, many warriors are aiming for that place.

00:00:10.040 --> 00:00:12.490
They place within their swords the feelings of ambition that are hidden within them.

00:00:12.490 --> 00:00:15.840
Thus, the burning competition, Queen's Blade, continues.

00:00:22.520 --> 00:00:26.590
Finally, the road to the Queen's capital has become open to us, Tomoe-sama.

00:00:26.590 --> 00:00:29.000
It's all thanks to Risty's map.

00:00:30.330 --> 00:00:32.660
<i>Can I really use this?</i>

00:00:32.660 --> 00:00:36.430
<i>Well, it doesn't really seem like actual money in the first place...</i>

00:00:36.680 --> 00:00:37.430
Risty!

00:00:43.480 --> 00:00:44.520
Leina!

00:00:46.490 --> 00:00:48.160
I finally caught up to you.

00:00:49.530 --> 00:00:55.950
kagata kure hikaru yo mayoi wo uchi keshite

00:00:49.530 --> 00:00:55.950
かがたくれ光るよ迷いを打ち消し

00:00:49.530 --> 00:00:55.950
The blazing light will chase the doubts away

00:00:56.200 --> 00:01:04.670
yowake ga kuru no nara osorezuni kono DOOR wo hirakao

00:00:56.200 --> 00:01:04.670
よわけが来るのなら恐れ済みこのドアを平子

00:00:56.200 --> 00:01:04.670
And when the dawn comes the door will open

00:01:15.010 --> 00:01:20.670
Moshimo itsuka hohoende kureru hi ga kuru nara

00:01:15.010 --> 00:01:20.670
もしもいつか微笑んでくれる日がくるなら

00:01:15.010 --> 00:01:20.670
If there ever comes a day where you can smile

00:01:21.220 --> 00:01:27.190
sore wa kitto nani ka ga kawatte shunkan

00:01:21.220 --> 00:01:27.190
それはきっと何かが変わって瞬間

00:01:21.220 --> 00:01:27.190
Something will definitely change in that moment

00:01:27.480 --> 00:01:32.860
tsuyoku naritai no negau yori mo ima wa

00:01:27.480 --> 00:01:32.860
強くなりたいの願うよりも今は

00:01:27.480 --> 00:01:32.860
It is now my wish to become strong

00:01:33.820 --> 00:01:39.490
tada tsuyoku naru no ka watashi dake ga moteru

00:01:33.820 --> 00:01:39.490
ただ強くならのか私だけが持てる

00:01:33.820 --> 00:01:39.490
Is becoming strong all that I can hope for?

00:01:39.580 --> 00:01:45.660
kotae wo shiritai

00:01:39.580 --> 00:01:45.660
答えを知りたい

00:01:39.580 --> 00:01:45.660
I want to know the answer

00:01:45.960 --> 00:01:52.550
kagata kure hikaru yo mayoi wo uchikeshite

00:01:45.960 --> 00:01:52.550
かがたくれ光るよ迷いを打ち消し

00:01:45.960 --> 00:01:52.550
The blazing light will chase the doubts away

00:01:52.880 --> 00:01:58.800
omoi de bakari wo nazoru dake ja naku

00:01:52.880 --> 00:01:58.800
重いでばかりを謎るだけじゃなく

00:01:52.880 --> 00:01:58.800
My feelings do nothing but puzzle me

00:01:58.970 --> 00:02:04.980
kore kara kaerareru mirai ga hajimaru

00:01:58.970 --> 00:02:04.980
是から帰られる未来が始まる

00:01:58.970 --> 00:02:04.980
From now on I will change, my future is beginning

00:02:05.180 --> 00:02:15.080
yoake ga kuru no nara osorezuni kono DOOR wo hiraka wo

00:02:05.180 --> 00:02:15.080
夜明けが来るのなら恐れずにこのドアを平鹿

00:02:05.180 --> 00:02:15.080
And when the dawn comes, the door will open

00:02:29.810 --> 00:02:30.750
This is...

00:02:30.750 --> 00:02:33.780
Yes, I've kept it safe since then.

00:02:33.780 --> 00:02:37.040
The goal of my journey has been to give it back to you.

00:02:37.770 --> 00:02:40.840
Is that so? You gave it your all, huh?

00:02:41.160 --> 00:02:44.880
I've certainly received it. Now get out of here.

00:02:46.110 --> 00:02:46.800
Hey!

00:02:47.090 --> 00:02:48.470
Risty, wait!

00:02:48.470 --> 00:02:49.950
I want you to listen to me properly.

00:02:49.950 --> 00:02:54.440
If you hadn't been there... If you hadn't saved me at that time...

00:02:54.440 --> 00:02:56.400
I would have died without knowing anything.

00:02:56.700 --> 00:03:00.730
You wouldn't have come all this way just to say that, of all things.

00:03:00.920 --> 00:03:03.000
I wanted to thank you properly.

00:03:04.210 --> 00:03:06.660
But... That's not all.

00:03:08.800 --> 00:03:09.830
Leina-san?

00:03:12.540 --> 00:03:14.910
There's no meaning in fighting you.

00:03:15.100 --> 00:03:16.830
Even if it was for Queen's Blade?

00:03:21.250 --> 00:03:25.180
The Vagrant Warrior, Leina, is finally participating in Queen's Blade!

00:03:26.200 --> 00:03:29.540
I want to take a step forward by battling you!

00:03:29.540 --> 00:03:32.100
That's fine, isn't it? As long as it's Queen's Blade.

00:03:55.090 --> 00:03:59.000
What's the problem? You're going to participate in Queen's Blade, right?

00:04:01.040 --> 00:04:03.710
Hey, don't start all by yourself.

00:04:04.030 --> 00:04:08.390
Um... Both participants are in position, let the Queen's Blade competition begin!

00:04:18.940 --> 00:04:21.050
That's enough, Risty-san!

00:04:22.330 --> 00:04:24.010
You've already won this battle.

00:04:24.010 --> 00:04:25.920
Why are you stopping us?

00:04:25.920 --> 00:04:26.610
Leina-san...

00:04:26.950 --> 00:04:31.640
A weakling like you wants to participate in Queen's Blade? Stop messing around!

00:04:31.640 --> 00:04:33.830
That's not... I'm not weak{fscx200}-

00:04:34.960 --> 00:04:39.560
You were beat up in the wrestling competition, got toyed around with by demons...

00:04:39.560 --> 00:04:42.480
Truly, the definition of weak.

00:04:42.480 --> 00:04:45.960
Someone like you would be better off doing gymnastics.

00:04:47.080 --> 00:04:50.250
I agree with Risty.

00:04:50.250 --> 00:04:55.430
We cannot allow people who don't understand their own strength to participate in Queen's Blade.

00:04:57.640 --> 00:05:01.190
The winner: Chivalrous Thief of the Wasteland, Risty!

00:05:10.640 --> 00:05:13.580
Perfect timing. Take Leina and go home!

00:05:13.830 --> 00:05:16.460
You aren't interested in anything, huh?

00:05:16.460 --> 00:05:20.500
If I took her home right now, that wouldn't be any fun.

00:05:20.880 --> 00:05:22.720
That's your job, isn't it?

00:05:22.720 --> 00:05:25.110
You're not being honest with yourself, are you?

00:05:25.110 --> 00:05:30.420
You should be a little happier that she came all the way out here to meet with you...

00:05:30.950 --> 00:05:33.300
You're being used like a dog...

00:05:33.300 --> 00:05:35.640
You should just do your job the way people tell you to.

00:05:36.310 --> 00:05:40.990
You aren't the one using me, though.

00:05:44.890 --> 00:05:48.530
So there's another person here who just won't listen.

00:05:50.370 --> 00:05:51.200
Here's your reward.

00:05:52.490 --> 00:05:53.910
I'll incinerate you.

00:05:55.990 --> 00:06:00.410
The second round today! Let's go! Nanael's on a roll!

00:06:00.870 --> 00:06:04.630
The challenger, Veteran Mercenary, Echidna...

00:06:04.630 --> 00:06:07.550
will face the Chivalrous Thief of the Wasteland, Risty!

00:06:09.720 --> 00:06:12.430
I didn't like you from the start!

00:06:12.620 --> 00:06:17.690
Oh, but I don't hate you. You're so predictable.

00:06:18.570 --> 00:06:22.850
<i>What bloodlust. Even Leina-san should be able to feel it.</i>

00:06:22.980 --> 00:06:25.020
This should be a bit interesting.

00:06:46.190 --> 00:06:47.420
Whoa!

00:06:47.600 --> 00:06:51.220
<i>So this is Queen's Blade?</i>

00:06:56.410 --> 00:07:00.430
Listen! If she enters Queen's Blade, she'll definitely die!

00:07:01.340 --> 00:07:03.380
You don't understand, do you?

00:07:03.380 --> 00:07:07.650
No matter what you say, she won't give up.

00:07:09.650 --> 00:07:12.280
It would have been better if I made her understand this earlier.

00:07:12.400 --> 00:07:17.530
You want to see her grow stronger from now on, do you?

00:07:17.720 --> 00:07:21.240
Queen's Blade is no game!

00:07:22.020 --> 00:07:23.260
Snake Tail!

00:07:27.880 --> 00:07:29.790
What was that?

00:07:36.690 --> 00:07:38.800
What is it? Why are you stopping?

00:07:39.590 --> 00:07:41.310
I'll wait three days.

00:07:41.820 --> 00:07:48.020
Even if the Queen's capital is right in front of us, don't let your guard down on the way there.

00:07:48.830 --> 00:07:52.440
In three days, we'll fight once more.

00:07:53.300 --> 00:07:55.000
I don't think it'll make much a difference, though.

00:07:55.000 --> 00:07:55.990
Risty...

00:07:57.430 --> 00:08:00.370
This match will be put on hold!

00:08:00.370 --> 00:08:02.540
Do you guys actually want to do this!?

00:08:02.910 --> 00:08:06.620
Nanael will get angry if you don't make up your minds already!

00:08:15.480 --> 00:08:19.260
As expected from a town near the capital, this place is quite lively.

00:08:19.520 --> 00:08:23.180
Say, do you want to visit the palace or the town center...

00:08:25.370 --> 00:08:27.640
<i>I guess you wouldn't, huh.</i>

00:08:28.920 --> 00:08:34.120
I can't believe that the match was delayed. Today was really exhausting, wasn't it, Nanael-san?

00:08:34.120 --> 00:08:38.810
Yes. To be honest, I had no time at all to relax, but this is my job.

00:08:38.810 --> 00:08:41.410
So it seems that we can look forward to tomorrow, right?

00:08:41.410 --> 00:08:44.450
Yes! Everyone's support is becoming my strength!

00:08:44.740 --> 00:08:49.520
Everyone, please continue cheering me on in the future!

00:08:49.970 --> 00:08:52.790
Thank you, thank you.

00:08:53.060 --> 00:08:55.240
That angel sure is annoying.

00:08:54.590 --> 00:08:57.960
It's all thanks to you!

00:08:56.080 --> 00:08:57.960
This is becoming a problem.

00:08:57.960 --> 00:08:59.590
Who wants an apple?

00:08:59.600 --> 00:09:03.890
So, Nanael-san, what are you aiming for next? The annual Most Valuable Angel award?

00:08:59.600 --> 00:09:03.890
\h    TL Note: This is a play on words. "saiyuushuusenshu"    \h
\h    means "M.V.P.", Nanael says "saiyuushuutenshi" here..    \h

00:09:03.890 --> 00:09:06.830
You think I can do it? Well, I guess I do have the talent...

00:09:06.830 --> 00:09:08.150
Who wants some grapes?

00:09:08.150 --> 00:09:10.020
I do! I do! I do!

00:09:14.410 --> 00:09:18.190
The annual Most Valuable Grape Angel...

00:09:21.400 --> 00:09:22.890
A sleeping pill?

00:09:22.890 --> 00:09:25.570
So these work on angels, too.

00:09:26.880 --> 00:09:32.210
Leina-san, I must apologize for saying things I shouldn't have.

00:09:34.360 --> 00:09:39.420
This secret elf medicine is fascinating. The swelling is already going down.

00:09:40.930 --> 00:09:47.020
Everyone... Everyone is carrying heavy burdens on their shoulders, aren't they?

00:09:47.800 --> 00:09:51.740
Risty is trying to save those suffering children

00:09:51.740 --> 00:09:54.710
and Nowa and Cattleya-san are both dealing with their own problems.

00:09:54.710 --> 00:09:58.530
They all carry something, and because of that, they participate in Queen's Blade.

00:09:59.410 --> 00:10:05.120
Tomoe, even you came from a distant country and have your own reasons for fighting.

00:10:07.790 --> 00:10:11.540
But I have nothing like that...

00:10:11.980 --> 00:10:16.960
I don't have a greater purpose, or greater ambitions... I have nothing.

00:10:17.760 --> 00:10:20.630
But... Even so, I...

00:10:21.010 --> 00:10:22.340
Leina-san...

00:10:25.340 --> 00:10:32.840
Whether it's great or small, if there's something that you want to accomplish...

00:10:32.840 --> 00:10:34.560
isn't that enough?

00:10:35.760 --> 00:10:40.990
I think so. Leina-san, when you decided to participate in Queen's Blade...

00:10:41.850 --> 00:10:44.660
what kind of feelings did you have? {wat, help me edit}

00:10:48.780 --> 00:10:51.620
So you're traveling to the capital tonight?

00:10:51.780 --> 00:10:55.090
Yeah, I want to prepare the assassination squad's movements.

00:10:55.090 --> 00:10:57.140
I'll go ahead a bit earlier.

00:10:57.140 --> 00:11:01.900
It's not as if you're alone, Tomoe-sama, but... I guess we can't really depend on her.

00:11:01.900 --> 00:11:03.960
You mustn't say such things!

00:11:19.510 --> 00:11:21.150
Leina-san...

00:11:28.100 --> 00:11:31.160
Have your wounds already healed?

00:11:37.120 --> 00:11:38.080
Please teach me.

00:11:39.290 --> 00:11:42.090
Please teach me how to fight!

00:11:44.710 --> 00:11:45.810
I beg you!

00:11:52.060 --> 00:11:57.770
If you let me touch them just once, I'll show you <i>everything.</i>

00:11:57.770 --> 00:12:00.190
Eh? Something like that...

00:12:03.280 --> 00:12:06.640
The way you take everything seriously is so cute.

00:12:06.640 --> 00:12:07.900
Geez!

00:12:30.340 --> 00:12:31.690
One, two!

00:12:33.350 --> 00:12:35.600
Alright, that should do it.

00:12:37.390 --> 00:12:38.230
Undress.

00:12:42.950 --> 00:12:44.750
Leina's been gone since I woke up.

00:12:44.750 --> 00:12:46.610
Wh-what are you doing?

00:12:53.490 --> 00:12:55.830
I won't let you escape.

00:12:57.190 --> 00:12:58.620
It's so hot...

00:12:59.460 --> 00:13:03.420
Should I put it here? Or maybe here?

00:13:03.420 --> 00:13:05.320
What the hell are they doing?

00:13:05.320 --> 00:13:07.000
H-How perverse!

00:13:07.000 --> 00:13:09.390
I didn't hear anything about this! Help me!

00:13:08.490 --> 00:13:09.390
There!

00:13:16.170 --> 00:13:18.520
It feels squishy, and kind of weird!

00:13:19.180 --> 00:13:20.240
Here I come!

00:13:26.650 --> 00:13:29.950
They're really into it! Warriors who wish to participate in Queen's Blade{fscx200}-

00:13:29.950 --> 00:13:33.850
Be quiet! That's not Queen's Blade!

00:13:34.060 --> 00:13:35.260
It's not?

00:13:36.160 --> 00:13:37.650
What are you doing all of a sudden?

00:13:39.510 --> 00:13:42.390
That was a direct hit. but I wasn't injured?

00:13:42.390 --> 00:13:44.710
Couldn't you feel the bloodlust?

00:13:44.790 --> 00:13:48.880
'What are you doing all of a sudden?' She says...

00:13:49.220 --> 00:13:56.390
Did you think I'd kindly and gently explain to you how to hold your sword? How to move your feet?

00:13:56.390 --> 00:13:59.270
You're as naïve as always, sweetheart.

00:14:01.140 --> 00:14:03.500
What is this feeling?

00:14:04.050 --> 00:14:06.230
No, this is pure bloodlust.

00:14:06.710 --> 00:14:09.320
To think that she can release this much of it instantly...

00:14:09.570 --> 00:14:11.230
Echidna-san, you couldn't be...

00:14:11.230 --> 00:14:18.370
You asked <i>me</i> to teach <i>you</i> how to fight in only three days? Just what were you expecting?

00:14:19.050 --> 00:14:21.140
Echidna...

00:14:21.140 --> 00:14:25.180
You'll be killed by Risty if you don't throw away your weaknesses.

00:14:25.180 --> 00:14:30.920
If that's the case, <i>I</i> might as well kill you!

00:14:33.580 --> 00:14:36.300
Is that how you should respond to your opponent?

00:14:47.440 --> 00:14:48.610
I'm not cut...

00:14:48.610 --> 00:14:50.640
I was sure that{fscx200}-

00:14:50.640 --> 00:14:53.340
Did you think you were cut?

00:14:53.740 --> 00:14:57.920
Did you feel that your life was ending?

00:14:58.160 --> 00:15:04.700
Yes, I intend to kill you with my attacks.

00:15:04.700 --> 00:15:07.040
You'll die a second time now.

00:15:07.140 --> 00:15:10.180
Echi...dna...

00:15:10.180 --> 00:15:14.940
What's wrong? Can't you stop your hands from shaking?

00:15:14.940 --> 00:15:16.680
Why don't you crawl on all fours?

00:15:17.660 --> 00:15:19.030
Are you afraid?

00:15:19.030 --> 00:15:20.470
Do you want to run away?

00:15:21.750 --> 00:15:25.650
This is what it means to battle!

00:15:26.180 --> 00:15:27.400
Die!

00:15:34.780 --> 00:15:36.090
Hey!

00:15:37.540 --> 00:15:39.830
Are you alright? You're frozen stiff.

00:15:39.990 --> 00:15:41.260
Nanael-san!

00:15:41.710 --> 00:15:42.920
What about those two?

00:15:42.920 --> 00:15:46.550
They're still going at it. They're not taking any breaks at all.

00:15:46.550 --> 00:15:48.130
I wonder if they're alright.

00:15:49.110 --> 00:15:52.680
<i>What is with those movements? There is no form to them at all.</i>

00:15:52.930 --> 00:15:56.590
We should light the torches now. Echidna asked us to, didn't she?

00:15:57.490 --> 00:15:58.860
The sun will be setting soon.

00:15:58.860 --> 00:16:01.000
My, just when did it...

00:16:03.740 --> 00:16:06.110
This special training won't be of any use.

00:16:06.110 --> 00:16:09.670
She won't be able to do anything in just three days.

00:16:10.950 --> 00:16:12.120
Leina-san...

00:16:20.840 --> 00:16:23.620
Amazing, they're still at it!

00:16:24.320 --> 00:16:25.810
Don't tell me they've been going at it nonstop...

00:16:25.810 --> 00:16:26.480
Yes.

00:16:27.320 --> 00:16:29.120
I wonder if they're alright.

00:16:29.120 --> 00:16:31.570
Situations like this are quite common on the battlefield.

00:16:31.570 --> 00:16:34.250
Moreover, Leina's stance has changed.

00:16:36.180 --> 00:16:40.070
She's refined her unnecessary power and has even learned the intricacies of swordplay.

00:16:40.640 --> 00:16:45.550
If that's the real Leina, then she's definitely strong.

00:16:45.550 --> 00:16:48.410
Really? I can't really tell.

00:16:48.410 --> 00:16:51.130
But why is there such a difference from before?

00:16:51.130 --> 00:16:56.870
Lack of concentration and absolute lack of experience.

00:16:57.650 --> 00:17:04.120
She didn't understand that she might die just by taking her sword and standing on the battlefield.

00:17:05.920 --> 00:17:09.290
Anyways, I'd like Leina to survive.

00:17:10.280 --> 00:17:15.100
It also seems as though she's fighting with a new sword style.

00:17:15.100 --> 00:17:22.760
It is most likely a style she picked up while surreptitiously watching many people during her journey.

00:17:24.090 --> 00:17:27.010
<i>I wonder how long I've been standing now?</i>

00:17:27.750 --> 00:17:30.570
<i>It feels like we've been hitting each other forever</i>

00:17:30.570 --> 00:17:33.240
<i>and I have the feeling that this is far from over.</i>

00:17:36.450 --> 00:17:40.740
They've been at it for a day and a half now.

00:17:41.340 --> 00:17:43.030
Let's trust Leina.

00:18:02.140 --> 00:18:03.840
It's morning.

00:18:04.300 --> 00:18:06.260
The day of the decisive battle.

00:18:08.620 --> 00:18:12.770
There's an unbelievable tension swirling between them.

00:18:13.870 --> 00:18:17.690
Leina's energy is also flowing flawlessly.

00:18:18.900 --> 00:18:21.400
This is beauty in its natural state.

00:18:21.720 --> 00:18:27.330
What Leina really needed wasn't flamboyant techniques or a precious sword...

00:18:27.660 --> 00:18:33.400
but to concentrate on the power within her without being afraid of the opponent's attacks. Flexibility.

00:18:34.120 --> 00:18:39.670
The ability to focus and stay levelheaded even when she has the upper hand. Insight.

00:18:51.770 --> 00:18:56.540
And the essential attack, a blow that chills the soul. The fatal strike.

00:18:58.090 --> 00:19:01.190
Well then, I'll go on ahead. Don't be late!

00:19:05.240 --> 00:19:11.040
Snake Tail... No, Dragon Tail would be a better name.

00:19:11.430 --> 00:19:15.250
The name of your attack. I just decided on it.

00:19:15.250 --> 00:19:18.460
It really is a splendid technique.

00:19:18.830 --> 00:19:20.940
Dragon Tail?

00:19:25.190 --> 00:19:28.930
We musn't be late. We should depart now.

00:19:29.030 --> 00:19:29.600
Yes.

00:19:34.950 --> 00:19:36.160
Thank you, Echidna.

00:19:36.160 --> 00:19:40.430
It's nothing. With that, you should be in a great physical condition.

00:19:41.370 --> 00:19:43.780
Also... Don't forget this.

00:19:48.460 --> 00:19:52.260
I should probably call you Master from now on.

00:19:54.620 --> 00:19:58.960
Since you're my pupil, we'll have to start some special night training sessions, won't we?

00:19:58.960 --> 00:20:02.680
Ah... well... that is...

00:20:05.300 --> 00:20:10.820
No matter how much strength or skill you possess, without resolve, it's meaningless.

00:20:10.820 --> 00:20:15.970
You've learned that today. But you only have the knowledge.

00:20:15.970 --> 00:20:17.850
It will be difficult to stand your ground.

00:20:18.350 --> 00:20:23.480
That's right. I don't carry the heavy burdens that everyone else does.

00:20:24.060 --> 00:20:26.200
And I don't have any great ambitions.

00:20:27.120 --> 00:20:34.130
But I want to fight. Fight, and see what I can do with my own strength.

00:20:36.180 --> 00:20:39.100
All warriors who wish to participate in Queen's Blade:

00:20:39.100 --> 00:20:42.510
Prove your skills as warriors, here in this place!

00:20:43.260 --> 00:20:46.930
The warrior's name is Risty, the Chivalrous Thief of the Wasteland!

00:20:46.930 --> 00:20:48.800
And her opponent is...

00:20:51.200 --> 00:20:52.050
What!?

00:20:56.940 --> 00:20:58.530
Risty.

00:20:58.530 --> 00:21:00.680
Now, let's begin...

00:21:00.680 --> 00:21:01.940
Queen's Blade!

00:21:12.300 --> 00:21:13.240
The victor:

00:21:15.840 --> 00:21:21.400
Lightning General, Claudette!

00:21:33.340 --> 00:21:36.350
Unsheathe your sword, Leina!

00:21:43.060 --> 00:21:48.550
wasurenai kara anata no koto

00:21:43.060 --> 00:21:48.550
忘れないから貴方のこと

00:21:43.060 --> 00:21:48.550
I won't forget about you

00:21:48.550 --> 00:21:52.330
donna ni jikan ga hettemo

00:21:48.550 --> 00:21:52.330
どんなに時間が経っても

00:21:48.550 --> 00:21:52.330
No matter how much time passes

00:21:52.330 --> 00:22:01.450
umaku ienai kimochi bakari afurete kuru

00:21:52.330 --> 00:22:01.450
うまく言えない気持ちばかり溢れてくる

00:21:52.330 --> 00:22:01.450
I can't express my overflowing feelings well.

00:22:11.220 --> 00:22:15.100
itsuka konna mainichi ga

00:22:11.220 --> 00:22:15.100
いつかこんな毎日が

00:22:11.220 --> 00:22:15.100
Until one day, when this every day life

00:22:15.100 --> 00:22:19.190
natsukashiku naru hi ga kuru made wa

00:22:15.100 --> 00:22:19.190
懐かしくなる日が来るまでは

00:22:15.100 --> 00:22:19.190
Becomes a memory I would look back at

00:22:19.190 --> 00:22:24.270
itsumo kokoro no katasumi ni

00:22:19.190 --> 00:22:24.270
いつも心の片隅に

00:22:19.190 --> 00:22:24.270
I would like to keep it locked away

00:22:24.270 --> 00:22:29.160
shizuka ni shimatte okitai

00:22:24.270 --> 00:22:29.160
静かにしまっておきたい

00:22:24.270 --> 00:22:29.160
In the quiet corner of my heart.

00:22:29.740 --> 00:22:37.540
yakusoku nante chiisa na ki yasume

00:22:29.740 --> 00:22:37.540
約束なんて小さな気休め

00:22:29.740 --> 00:22:37.540
Promises are but consolations.

00:22:37.540 --> 00:22:42.630
ashita o mukaeru tame ni tsuita

00:22:37.540 --> 00:22:42.630
明日を迎えるためについた

00:22:37.540 --> 00:22:42.630
They may very well be,

00:22:42.630 --> 00:22:48.450
yasashii uso kamoshirenai

00:22:42.630 --> 00:22:48.450
優しい嘘かもしれない

00:22:42.630 --> 00:22:48.450
Simple lies to face tomorrow.

00:22:49.970 --> 00:22:55.390
shinjiteru kara ano hi no koto

00:22:49.970 --> 00:22:55.390
信じてるからあの日のこと

00:22:49.970 --> 00:22:55.390
I'll continue to believe in the day we made our promise,

00:22:55.390 --> 00:22:59.150
donna ni jikan ga tattemo

00:22:55.390 --> 00:22:59.150
どんなに時間が経っても

00:22:55.390 --> 00:22:59.150
No matter how much time passes by,

00:22:59.150 --> 00:23:08.650
ima no watashi wo sasaeteru taisetsu na mono

00:22:59.150 --> 00:23:08.650
今の私を支えてる大切なもの

00:22:59.150 --> 00:23:08.650
It is my wish to tell you everything.

00:23:14.620 --> 00:23:17.200
Well, I, for one, have been getting bored lately.

00:23:17.200 --> 00:23:19.040
Meeting Leina was the worst thing ever.

00:23:19.040 --> 00:23:24.250
My <i>Rise-To-The-Heavens and Get-The-Divine-Grapes for Myself</i> plan was ruined thanks to her.

00:23:24.250 --> 00:23:25.990
Well, I didn't really have a plan like that,

00:23:25.990 --> 00:23:32.400
but I can't stand how lucky, privileged, and favored Leina is for getting a special move.

00:23:32.400 --> 00:23:33.550
But this is the end for her.

00:23:33.550 --> 00:23:35.560
I hereby summon the strongest assassin!

00:23:35.560 --> 00:23:36.730
Just kidding.

00:23:36.730 --> 00:23:38.770
Next time: Thunder ~ After the Death Battle!

00:23:38.770 --> 00:23:41.900
We'll finally see the fated battle of the sisters!
